Reason:
The incorrect sequence of case numbers in the `onUpgrade` method caused the database migration logic to skip necessary updates, leading to potential data integrity issues. Specifically, the migration logic for case 9 was incorrectly labeled as case 10, which meant that critical database fixes were not applied when upgrading from version 9 to 10.

